  "title": "Fire in the Whole",
  "description": "U.S. Marines with 2nd Combat Engineer Battalion, 2d Marine Division (MARDIV) as well as Combined Anti-Armor Team, 2d MARDIV fire a M58 Mine Clearing Lane Charge (MICLIC) from Assault Amphibious Vehicles and from an Expeditionary Modular Autonomous Vehicle (EMAV) on Marine Corps Air-Ground Combat Center, Twentynine Palms, Calif., Feb. 01, 2021. The firing of the MICLIC from the EMAV gave the Marine Corps a chance to survey new ways to be combat effective. (U.S. Marine Corps video by Lance Cpl. Jessica Massi)",
